Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse error on the full pool to see if weighting improves over simple mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the pooled_meta_model handle (w1) to see if a meta‑model weighting outperforms inverse_error.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"w1"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on the full model pool to see if it outperforms the current weighted inverse‑error leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a single best model (ETS) to see if it outperforms the weighted combination.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ETS"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean of the full pool to see if trimming improves over the best single ETS.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse_error on the smaller pool1 to see if a more focused set improves over best_single ETS.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Evaluate a DBA (differential back‑adaption) combination on the full pool to see if it outperforms the best single ETS.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool_full","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on pool2 using inverse_error to see if a smaller, more stable pool improves over ETS single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination over the full pool using inverse_error to see if a larger pool with inverse error weighting improves over ETS single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a simple mean of the smaller, more stable pool2 to see if averaging out reduces variance compared to weighted or best single ETS.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean on the smaller, more stable pool1 to see if robustness improves over weighted or best single ETS.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool1","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a median combination on the smaller, more stable pool1 to see if it improves over trimmed mean and weighted.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

